<title>CHINA: CHINA'S 1.2 BLN PEOPLE HAVE 140 MLN COLOUR TVS.</title>
<headline>CHINA'S 1.2 BLN PEOPLE HAVE 140 MLN COLOUR TVS.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's 1.2 billion people own 140 million colour television sets, with 93.5 sets for every 100 urban families and 22.9 sets for every 100 rural families, the Business News said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Investment in the television industry since the late 1970s had topped 25 billion yuan, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>More than 300,000 people were now employed in the industry, it said.</p>
<p>-- Shanghai Newsroom (8621) 6279-7004 fax: 6279-7174</p>
</text>
